    &gt;PDF&lt;/a&gt; · &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/bojieli/ai-agent-book/releases/download/latest/AI-Agents-in-Depth-en.epub&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
